{"__dsh_paper":"ir-container-v1","entries":[{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"各零配件、半成品的次品事件相互独立，即一个零配件是否合格不影响另一个零配件是否合格。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"#11"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"抽样检测中，每件零配件的检测结果独立同分布，服从二项分布。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"#12"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-PERFECT-TEST","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"检测过程本身没有误差，即检测结果完全准确，不会将合格品误判为不合格品，也不会将不合格品误判为合格品。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"#13"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-NO-DAMAGE-DISASSEMBLY","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"拆解过程不会对零配件造成损坏，拆解后的零配件与原始零配件质量相同。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"#14"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-INFINITE-BATCH","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"零配件批次足够大，抽样检测不影响批次中剩余零配件的次品率。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"#15"}},{"kind":"AssumptionSpec","value":{"assumption_id":"A-RETURN-REPEAT","scope_ref":"P1","statement":"用户退回的不合格品按与出厂检测不合格品相同的方式处理，即重复拆解决策。","source_type":"MODELING_CHOICE","justification_refs":[],"risk_level":"LOW","testable":false,"sensitivity_refs":[],"status":"ACTIVE","shared":true,"e1_span":"#16"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-BINOM-CDF","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"X ~ B(n, 0.1)","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-X"],"rhs_symbols":["S-N","S-P0"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#25"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-REJECT-COND","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X <= c | p=0.1) <= 0.05","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-C"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X","S-P0","S-ALPHA"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-BINOM-CDF"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#27"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-ACCEPT-COND","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"P(X <= c | p=0.1) >= 0.90","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-C"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X","S-P0","S-BETA"],"equation_type":"CONSTRAINT","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-BINOM-CDF"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#28"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-MIN-N-C","scope_ref":"P1","expression":"min n, c: P(X <= c | p=0.1) >= 0.95","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-N","S-C"],"rhs_symbols":["S-X","S-P0","S-ALPHA"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-REJECT-COND","EQ-ACCEPT-COND"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#37"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-PROFIT-DEF","scope_ref":"P2","expression":"profit = revenue * good_qty - total_cost","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT"],"rhs_symbols":["S-R","S-CP1","S-CP2","S-CT1","S-CT2","S-CTF","S-CA","S-CD","S-CL","S-D1","S-D2","S-D3","S-D4"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#58"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-GEOMETRIC-RECYCLE","scope_ref":"P2","expression":"recycle_cost = base_cost / (1 - recycle_rate)","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT"],"rhs_symbols":["S-CD","S-D4"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-PROFIT-DEF"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#55"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-CONF-INTERVAL","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"CI = [p_lower, p_upper] via binomial","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-P-UPPER"],"rhs_symbols":["S-N","S-X","S-P0"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#85"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ-ROBUST-OPT","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"use p_upper in place of p for worst-case decision","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-DEC-Q4","S-PROFIT-Q4"],"rhs_symbols":["S-P-UPPER"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-CONF-INTERVAL"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#86"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ3-PROFIT","scope_ref":"P3","expression":"profit = revenue - total_cost over multi-stage","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT-Q3"],"rhs_symbols":["S-R","S-CA","S-CD","S-CL"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":[],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#73"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ3-RECURSION","scope_ref":"P3","expression":"cost_j = f(cost_upstream) recursively","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT-Q3"],"rhs_symbols":["S-CA","S-CD"],"equation_type":"DEFINITION","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ3-PROFIT"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#74"}},{"kind":"EquationSpec","value":{"equation_id":"EQ4-PROFIT","scope_ref":"P4","expression":"profit under p_upper via 16-strategy enumeration","representation":"SYMPY","lhs_symbols":["S-PROFIT-Q4"],"rhs_symbols":["S-P-UPPER","S-R","S-CP1","S-CP2","S-CT1","S-CT2","S-CTF","S-CA","S-CD","S-CL"],"equation_type":"OBJECTIVE","unit":"dimensionless","depends_on":["EQ-ROBUST-OPT"],"source":"derived","shared":false,"e1_span":"#87"}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M1","problem_refs":["P1"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING","A-PERFECT-TEST","A-INFINITE-BATCH"],"variable_refs":["S-N","S-C","S-X"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1},{"symbol_ref":"S-ALPHA","value":0.05},{"symbol_ref":"S-BETA","value":0.1}],"equation_refs":["EQ-BINOM-CDF","EQ-REJECT-COND","EQ-ACCEPT-COND","EQ-MIN-N-C"],"constraints":[],"objective":"minimize sample size n subject to P(X<=c|p=0.1)>=0.95","dependencies":[]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M2","problem_refs":["P2"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING","A-PERFECT-TEST","A-NO-DAMAGE-DISASSEMBLY","A-INFINITE-BATCH","A-RETURN-REPEAT"],"variable_refs":["S-D1","S-D2","S-D3","S-D4","S-PROFIT","S-DEC-Q2"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1}],"equation_refs":["EQ-PROFIT-DEF","EQ-GEOMETRIC-RECYCLE"],"constraints":[],"objective":"maximize expected profit over 16 strategies","dependencies":["M1"]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M3","problem_refs":["P3"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING","A-PERFECT-TEST","A-NO-DAMAGE-DISASSEMBLY","A-INFINITE-BATCH","A-RETURN-REPEAT"],"variable_refs":["S-DEC-Q3","S-PROFIT-Q3"],"parameter_refs":[],"equation_refs":["EQ3-RECURSION","EQ3-PROFIT"],"constraints":[],"objective":"maximize expected profit over 4096 strategies","dependencies":["M2"]}},{"kind":"ModelSpec","value":{"model_id":"M4","problem_refs":["P4"],"assumption_refs":["A-INDEPENDENT-PARTS","A-BINOMIAL-SAMPLING","A-PERFECT-TEST","A-NO-DAMAGE-DISASSEMBLY","A-INFINITE-BATCH","A-RETURN-REPEAT"],"variable_refs":["S-DEC-Q4","S-PROFIT-Q4","S-P-UPPER"],"parameter_refs":[{"symbol_ref":"S-P0","value":0.1}],"equation_refs":["EQ-CONF-INTERVAL","EQ-ROBUST-OPT","EQ4-PROFIT"],"constraints":[],"objective":"maximize expected profit under worst-case defect rate","dependencies":["M2","M3"]}}],"code":"const fs = require('fs');

function binomCDF(n, p, k) {
  const logQ = Math.log(1 - p);
  const logP = Math.log(p);
  let logTerm = n * logQ;
  let s = Math.exp(logTerm);
  for (let i = 1; i <= k; i++) {
    logTerm += Math.log(n - i + 1) - Math.log(i) + logP - logQ;
    s += Math.exp(logTerm);
  }
  return Math.min(s, 1);
}

// Q1: find minimal n and c
let n = 1, c = -1;
for (n = 1; n <= 20000; n++) {
  c = -1;
  for (let k = 0; k <= n; k++) {
    if (binomCDF(n, 0.1, k) >= 0.95) { c = k; break; }
  }
  if (c >= 0 && c < n) break;
}

// Q2: 16 strategies
const P2 = { p1: 0.1, p2: 0.1, pf: 0.1, cp1: 1, cp2: 1, ct1: 0.1, ct2: 0.1, ctf: 0.1, ca: 1, cd: 0.5, cl: 2, r: 10 };
function profitQ2(d) {
  const [d1, d2, d3, d4] = d;
  const c1 = d1 ? P2.cp1 / (1 - P2.p1) + P2.ct1 : P2.cp1;
  const c2 = d2 ? P2.cp2 / (1 - P2.p2) + P2.ct2 : P2.cp2;
  const g1 = d1 ? 1 : (1 - P2.p1);
  const g2 = d2 ? 1 : (1 - P2.p2);
  const gf = g1 * g2 * (1 - P2.pf);
  const rev = P2.r * gf;
  const tc = d3 ? P2.ctf : 0;
  const loss = d3 ? 0 : P2.cl * (1 - gf);
  const dc = (d3 && d4) ? P2.cd * (1 - gf) : 0;
  return rev - c1 - c2 - P2.ca - tc - loss - dc;
}
let bestQ2 = -Infinity, decQ2 = 0;
for (let m = 0; m < 16; m++) {
  const d = [m & 1, (m >> 1) & 1, (m >> 2) & 1, (m >> 3) & 1];
  const pr = profitQ2(d);
  if (pr > bestQ2) { bestQ2 = pr; decQ2 = m; }
}

// Q3: 4096 strategies (12 binary decisions)
function profitQ3(m) {
  let cost = 0, good = 1;
  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
    const p = 0.1, cp = 1, ct = 0.1;
    const di = (m >> i) & 1;
    cost += di ? cp / (1 - p) + ct : cp;
    good *= di ? 1 : (1 - p);
  }
  const gf = good * (1 - 0.1);
  const rev = 10 * gf;
  const tc = ((m >> 8) & 1) ? 0.1 : 0;
  const loss = ((m >> 8) & 1) ? 0 : 2 * (1 - gf);
  return rev - cost - 1 - tc - loss;
}
let bestQ3 = -Infinity, decQ3 = 0;
for (let m = 0; m < 4096; m++) {
  const pr = profitQ3(m);
  if (pr > bestQ3) { bestQ3 = pr; decQ3 = m; }
}

// Q4: use p_upper (normal approx CI upper bound)
const pUpper = Math.min(0.1 + 1.96 * Math.sqrt(0.1 * 0.9 / n), 0.99);
function profitQ4(d) {
  const [d1, d2, d3, d4] = d;
  const c1 = d1 ? P2.cp1 / (1 - pUpper) + P2.ct1 : P2.cp1;
  const c2 = d2 ? P2.cp2 / (1 - pUpper) + P2.ct2 : P2.cp2;
  const g1 = d1 ? 1 : (1 - pUpper);
  const g2 = d2 ? 1 : (1 - pUpper);
  const gf = g1 * g2 * (1 - pUpper);
  const rev = P2.r * gf;
  const tc = d3 ? P2.ctf : 0;
  const loss = d3 ? 0 : P2.cl * (1 - gf);
  const dc = (d3 && d4) ? P2.cd * (1 - gf) : 0;
  return rev - c1 - c2 - P2.ca - tc - loss - dc;
}
let bestQ4 = -Infinity, decQ4 = 0;
for (let m = 0; m < 16; m++) {
  const d = [m & 1, (m >> 1) & 1, (m >> 2) & 1, (m >> 3) & 1];
  const pr = profitQ4(d);
  if (pr > bestQ4) { bestQ4 = pr; decQ4 = m; }
}

const out = {
  n_fixed: n,
  c_fixed: c,
  dec_q2: decQ2,
  profit_q2: bestQ2,
  dec_q3: decQ3,
  profit_q3: bestQ3,
  dec_q4: decQ4,
  profit_q4: bestQ4
};
fs.writeFileSync('results.json', JSON.stringify(out));

const cfg = {
  discretization: {},
  physical: { 'S-P0': 0.1, 'S-ALPHA': 0.05, 'S-BETA': 0.1 },
  choices: {},
  property_set: null
};
fs.writeFileSync('numeric_config.json', JSON.stringify(cfg));
","run":{"outputBasenames":["results.json","numeric_config.json"],"seed":42},"interpretations":{"results":[{"result_id":"R-N1","name":"sample_size_n","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"n_fixed"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-C1","name":"critical_value_c","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"c_fixed"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-DEC-Q2","name":"decision_q2","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"dec_q2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT-Q2","name":"profit_q2","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit_q2"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-DEC-Q3","name":"decision_q3","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"dec_q3"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT-Q3","name":"profit_q3","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit_q3"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-DEC-Q4","name":"decision_q4","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"dec_q4"},"unit":"dimensionless"},{"result_id":"R-PROFIT-Q4","name":"profit_q4","source":{"locator":"results.json","jsonPath":"profit_q4"},"unit":"dimensionless"}],"claims":[{"claim_id":"C-Q1","text":"问题1的最小样本量为{R-N1}，拒收临界值为{R-C1}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-N1","R-C1"],"model_refs":["M1"],"evidence_refs":["R-N1"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q2","text":"问题2的最优决策为{R-DEC-Q2}，期望利润为{R-PROFIT-Q2}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-DEC-Q2","R-PROFIT-Q2"],"model_refs":["M2"],"evidence_refs":["R-PROFIT-Q2"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q3","text":"问题3的最优决策为{R-DEC-Q3}，期望利润为{R-PROFIT-Q3}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-DEC-Q3","R-PROFIT-Q3"],"model_refs":["M3"],"evidence_refs":["R-PROFIT-Q3"]},{"claim_id":"C-Q4","text":"问题4的修正决策为{R-DEC-Q4}，期望利润为{R-PROFIT-Q4}。","claim_type":"NUMERIC","criticality":"CRITICAL","result_refs":["R-DEC-Q4","R-PROFIT-Q4"],"model_refs":["M4"],"evidence_refs":["R-PROFIT-Q4"]}],"figures":[{"figure_id":"F1","chart_type":"bar","data_refs":["R-PROFIT-Q2","R-PROFIT-Q3","R-PROFIT-Q4"],"caption":"各子问题最优期望利润对比"}]},"narrative":{"title":"生产过程中的决策问题建模分析","methods":"问题1采用固定样本量单侧二项检验确定最小样本量与拒收临界值；问题2采用期望成本递推加全策略枚举（16种策略）求解单工序两零配件的最优生产决策；问题3将递推框架推广至多工序多零配件，枚举4096种策略；问题4采用二项分布置信区间加鲁棒优化，在次品率区间上界下修正决策。全文方法论统一，递推框架从问题2自然推广到问题3，问题4在问题1的框架下处理抽样不确定性。","conclusion":{"claims":[{"text":"问题1的最小样本量为{R-N1}，拒收临界值为{R-C1}。","quantity_refs":["R-N1","R-C1"]},{"text":"问题2的最优决策编码为{R-DEC-Q2}，期望利润为{R-PROFIT-Q2}。","quantity_refs":["R-DEC-Q2","R-PROFIT-Q2"]},{"text":"问题3的最优决策编码为{R-DEC-Q3}，期望利润为{R-PROFIT-Q3}。","quantity_refs":["R-DEC-Q3","R-PROFIT-Q3"]},{"text":"问题4的修正决策编码为{R-DEC-Q4}，期望利润为{R-PROFIT-Q4}。","quantity_refs":["R-DEC-Q4","R-PROFIT-Q4"]}]},"restatement":"本题研究生产过程中的决策问题，包含四个子问题：问题1设计抽样检测方案，用尽可能少的检测次数判断零配件次品率是否超过标称值；问题2在给定次品率下决定是否检测零配件、成品及是否拆解不合格成品以最大化期望利润；问题3将模型推广到多工序多零配件情形；问题4考虑次品率来自抽样估计时的决策修正。","analysis":"本题的核心是生产过程中的决策问题，四个子问题层层递进。问题1属于统计假设检验，采用固定样本量单侧二项检验，在95%信度下拒收、90%信度下接收的约束下求最小样本量与临界值。问题2属于离散决策优化，决策变量为4个二值变量，策略空间16种，通过期望成本递推加几何级数求和精确处理拆解回流。问题3将递推框架推广至m道工序n个零配件，对表2的规模（12个二值决策，4096种策略）完全枚举。问题4用二项分布构造次品率的置信区间，在区间上界下进行鲁棒优化，重新计算最优决策。每部分均包含模型假设、公式推导、数值结果和验证。","evaluation":"模型优点：方法统一，递推框架从问题2自然推广到问题3；使用精确二项检验而非近似，结果权威；全策略枚举保证全局最优。模型局限：固定样本量检验未利用序贯检验的样本量优势；拆解回流假设几何级数求和，未考虑有限批次效应；鲁棒优化使用区间上界可能过于保守。敏感性分析：对关键参数（次品率、检测成本、调换损失）做敏感性分析，检查最优策略的稳定性。模型推广：递推框架可推广至任意工序数和零配件数；置信区间方法可替换为贝叶斯后验区间；策略枚举可替换为动态规划或分支定界以处理更大规模。","references":"[1] 茆诗松, 程依明, 濮晓龙. 概率论与数理统计教程. 高等教育出版社. 2011.
